> I spent some time last night wondering about the *bane artifacts.  Are
> any of them really worth the time?  Which ones are most worthless?  And
> the brands?  Which one is better?  And just how effective is Mjollnir's
> extra d24 damage?  I found a rudimentary way to answer these questions.
>  First, I found each artifact's average damage against a monster that
> doesn't fall into any catgory that would activate special damage from
> the artifact.  I then calculated each one's average damage against a
> monster which activates its special extra damage.  I then calculated
> the ratio of monsters affected by this damage compared to the whole
> set.  The formula from there looked something like this:
> let p=(monsters affected)/(total monsters)
> let s=(damage vs specialty monster)
> let a=(damage vs non-specialized monster)
>
> wighted average=ps+(1-p)a
